<title>USA: Precision Response files for offering.</title>
<headline>Precision Response files for offering.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Precision Response Corp said on rsday it has filed to offer up to 4.74 million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>Precision Response said it will sell 1.5 million of the shares, while the balance will be sold by certain selling shareholders.</p>
<p>Precision Response provides telephone-based customer service and marketing solutions to large companies.</p>
